Package: com.wjf.pin120
Name: Pin120
Version: 2.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Unlocks 120fps in games on 60Hz iPads (Pro 2018/A12X). Spoofs UIScreen.maximumFramesPerSecond, forces CADisplayLink to 120Hz and pins Unity targetFrameRate. HUD in the top-left shows live status.
Maintainer: wjf
Author: wjf
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
